				<p><span avenir="" next="" style="color: rgba(40, 50, 40, 0.9); font-family: Poppins, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, ">At CACC, baseball isn&rsquo;t just a sport&mdash;it&rsquo;s a tradition. Our Trojans are no strangers to the big stage, with multiple conference titles under their belt and a reputation for producing next-level talent. From the first pitch of the season to the final out, these guys play with heart, hustle, and a whole lot of Trojan pride. When you step onto our field, you&#39;re part of a legacy.</span></p>

				
